OL,3,GNEWSABid to use new tax to replenish
OL,4,Aemergency fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempt will be made this week to
OL,7,Fensure some of the money the States of
OL,8,FGuernsey receives through a new tax on
OL,9,Fbusinesses is put into the government's
OL,10,Fsavings.
OL,12,FPolicy and Resources' treasury lead
OL,13,FCharles Parkinson revealed last month
OL,14,Fthe States was set to receive more from
OL,15,Fpillar two tax revenue than was
OL,16,Fpreviously estimated.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
