OL,3,GNEWSABid to use new tax to replenish
OL,4,Aemergency fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputies Gavin St Pier and George
OL,7,FOswald want to secure any pillar two
OL,8,Ftax revenue above #75m from 2025, #77m
OL,9,Fin 2026, #79m in 2027 and #74m in 2028
OL,10,Ffor the island's core investment
OL,11,Freserve.
OL,13,FThe core investment reserve is
OL,14,Feffectively the island's rainy-day
OL,15,Ffund, only to be used in emergencies.
